  "title": "Armenian-Style Potato Salad",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s Armenian-style potato salad provides a no-mayo, egg-free version of the classic traditional side dish that&#39;s full of flavor thanks to mint and bell pepper.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
